      "remediation": "Break the trifecta: remove or sandbox one leg. Common fixes: run untrusted-content tools in an isolated agent that has no private-data or exfil tools; require human approval on exfil actions; or apply content provenance / taint tracking so untrusted text can't trigger sensitive reads followed by outbound calls."
